.TH batten-record-forge 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-record\-forge \- Record the forge\*(Aqs check verdicts for one commit, read as `<check> <conclusion>` lines on stdin
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten record forge\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIref\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record the forge\*(Aqs check verdicts for one commit, read as `<check> <conclusion>` lines on stdin
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIref\fR>
The ref or sha the verdict was taken against
